[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 97 A small",
    "start": 1.53,
    "end": 5.032,
    "zh": "第97课 一个小",
    "zh_hant": "第97課 一個小"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "blue case Listen to the tape",
    "start": 4.692,
    "end": 9.174,
    "zh": "蓝色箱子 听录音",
    "zh_hant": "藍色箱子 聽錄音"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "then answer this question.",
    "start": 9.394,
    "end": 11.635,
    "zh": "然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Does Mr. Hall get his case back?",
    "start": 13.856,
    "end": 17.218,
    "zh": "霍尔先生拿回他的箱子了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "霍爾先生拿回他的箱子了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I left a suitcase on the train to London the other day.",
    "start": 19.579,
    "end": 22.981,
    "zh": "前几天我把一个手提箱落在去伦敦的火车上了。",
    "zh_hant": "前幾天我把一個手提箱落在去倫敦的火車上了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Can you describe it, sir?",
    "start": 24.202,
    "end": 26.182,
    "zh": "先生，您能描述一下它吗？",
    "zh_hant": "先生，您能描述一下它嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "It's a small blue case and it's got a zip.",
    "start": 27.143,
    "end": 31.225,
    "zh": "它是一个蓝色的小箱子，带拉链。",
    "zh_hant": "它是一個藍色的小箱子，帶拉鍊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "There's a label on the handle with my name",
    "start": 31.945,
    "end": 35.367,
    "zh": "提手上有个标签，上面有我的名字",
    "zh_hant": "提手上有個標籤，上面有我的名字"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "and address on it.",
    "start": 35.207,
    "end": 36.607,
    "zh": "和地址。",
    "zh_hant": "和地址。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Is this case yours?",
    "start": 37.948,
    "end": 40.029,
    "zh": "这个箱子是您的吗？",
    "zh_hant": "這個箱子是您的嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "No, that's not mine.",
    "start": 40.89,
    "end": 42.851,
    "zh": "不，那不是我的。",
    "zh_hant": "不，那不是我的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "What about this one?",
    "start": 43.712,
    "end": 45.712,
    "zh": "这个呢？",
    "zh_hant": "這個呢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "This one's got a label.",
    "start": 46.313,
    "end": 48.314,
    "zh": "这个有标签。",
    "zh_hant": "這個有標籤。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Let me see it.",
    "start": 49.314,
    "end": 50.675,
    "zh": "让我看看。",
    "zh_hant": "讓我看看。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "What's your name and address?",
    "start": 51.956,
    "end": 54.236,
    "zh": "您的姓名和地址是什么？",
    "zh_hant": "您的姓名和地址是什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "David Hall, 83, Bridge Street.",
    "start": 55.357,
    "end": 59.339,
    "zh": "大卫·霍尔，桥街83号。",
    "zh_hant": "大衛·霍爾，橋街83號。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 60.62,
    "end": 61.82,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "D. N. Hall,",
    "start": 62.341,
    "end": 65.242,
    "zh": "D. N. 霍尔，",
    "zh_hant": "D. N. 霍爾，"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "83, Bridge Street.",
    "start": 64.892,
    "end": 68.043,
    "zh": "桥街83号。",
    "zh_hant": "橋街83號。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Three pounds fifty pence, please.",
    "start": 69.064,
    "end": 71.765,
    "zh": "请付三英镑五十便士。",
    "zh_hant": "請付三英鎊五十便士。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Here you are.",
    "start": 72.746,
    "end": 73.726,
    "zh": "给你。",
    "zh_hant": "給你。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Thank you.",
    "start": 74.347,
    "end": 75.407,
    "zh": "谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Hey!",
    "start": 76.508,
    "end": 77.228,
    "zh": "嘿！",
    "zh_hant": "嘿！"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "What's the matter?",
    "start": 77.508,
    "end": 78.768,
    "zh": "怎么了？",
    "zh_hant": "怎麼了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "This case doesn't belong to me!",
    "start": 79.709,
    "end": 81.835,
    "zh": "这个箱子不是我的！",
    "zh_hant": "這個箱子不是我的！"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "You've given me the wrong case!",
    "start": 82.019,
    "end": 84.609,
    "zh": "你给我的箱子错了！",
    "zh_hant": "你給我的箱子錯了！"
  }
]
